<title>FRANCE: Arthuis maintains 2.3 pct 1997 growth forecast.</title>
<headline>Arthuis maintains 2.3 pct 1997 growth forecast.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>French Finance Minister Jean Arthuis told parliament on Thursday that he maintained his forecast for 2.3 percent growth in GDP for 1997.</p>
</text>
